my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
line one
line two
line three
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{S substitutes entire line},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `S` clears the entire line content and enters insert mode

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/substitute_line_S`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `line one`
- Line 2: `line two`
- Line 3: `line three`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0

Keys: `jS`, type `new content`, `Escape`

**after_S.png** (after):
- Line 1: `line one` (unchanged)
- Line 2: `new content` (was `line two`)
- Line 3: `line three` (unchanged)
- Cursor at line 2, col 10 (after `new content`)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('jS');
        $ctx->delay(50);
        $ctx->type('new content');
        $ctx->key('Escape');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_S');
    },
}
